Third-party material
--------------------

Rust crates
  TwinForge is built with open-source Rust crates, among them:

    blake3        content fingerprints          CC0-1.0 OR Apache-2.0
    xxhash-rust   XXH3 fingerprints             BSL-1.0
    image         picture decoding              MIT OR Apache-2.0
    lofty         audio tag reading             MIT OR Apache-2.0
    eframe / egui the window                    MIT OR Apache-2.0
    rfd           system file dialogs           MIT
    serde, serde_json                           MIT OR Apache-2.0
    windows       Windows API bindings          MIT OR Apache-2.0
    tiny-skia, embed-resource (build only)      BSD-3-Clause, MIT OR Apache-2.0 OR Zlib

  Each crate, and the crates they depend on, is used under its own licence;
  see Cargo.lock for the exact versions and each crate for its terms.

  The perceptual picture hashes, the fuzzy text matching, the selection rules
  and the guarded action engine are original code written for TwinForge.

Fonts
  TwinForge loads the Segoe UI and Segoe MDL2 Assets fonts that are installed
  with Windows at run time. They are not distributed with TwinForge.

TwinForge works entirely on this PC. It contacts no online service.
